SUMMARY:Cities: Skylines - Expanded Edition (Nintendo Switch 2)
DESCRIPTION:Developer: Tantalus Media\n\nPublisher: Paradox Interactive\n\n
 Build\, manage\, and expand the city of your dreams in Cities: Skylines – 
 Expanded Edition\, the award-winning city-building game optimized for Nint
 endo Switch 2 with 10 included DLC expansions and content packs.\n\nStart 
 with a few roads and grow your city into a bustling metropolitan hub. Plan
  neighborhoods\, manage public services\, shape civic policies\, and respo
 nd to the ever-changing needs of thousands of citizens. Whether you create
  a quiet coastal town\, a busy industrial center\, or a sprawling modern m
 etropolis\, your city is yours to design.\n\nOptimized and Expanded for Ni
 ntendo Switch 2\n\nExperience Cities: Skylines with upgrades designed for 
 large-scale city building on Nintendo Switch 2\, including improved visual
 s\, better performance\, expanded building tools\, and new ways to play.\n
 \n10 DLC Expansions & Content Packs included\n\nExpand your city with a co
 llection of additional content included in the Expanded Edition. Watch you
 r city transform at night with After Dark\, navigate winter transit networ
 ks in Snowfall\, build eco-conscious neighborhoods with Green Cities\, and
  manage bustling maritime hubs in Sunset Harbor.\nThe package also include
 s Map Pack 3\, Country Road\, Pearls from the East\, Deep Focus Radio\, Ca
 rols\, Candles & Candy\, and Match Day.\n\nhttps://www.igdb.com/games/citi
 es-skylines-expanded-edition
END:VEVENT
