 yalties and silent blades — determined to unravel the conspiracy that has 
 condemned him.\n\nRain mixes with blood\, mercy entangles with vengeance. 
 Soul's journey is one of love\, hate\, and the fragile search for what it 
 means to have a heart.\n\nhttps://www.igdb.com/games/phantom-blade-zero
