 e you come in. Make sure they eat a half-decent meal every now and again\,
  fix their gear\, get them to rehearse… Hope you like herding cats!\n\nDon
 ’t Stop Me Now: It’s your job to book the venue\, finalize the setlist and
  ensure the gig goes according to the plan. Each successful performance is
